# QA test cases (Cursor 101 demo)

When writing test cases from a story under `docs/stories/`:

- Use `docs/test-cases/TEMPLATE.md` (TC-01 headings, Type, Priority, Source, Given, When, Then, Not in story, Open questions).
- Include at least one Negative and one Boundary case per story set.
- Only cite acceptance criteria that appear in the story file.

When automating:

- Add Playwright specs under `tests/e2e/*.spec.ts`.
- Follow the style in `tests/e2e/search.spec.ts` and prefer `data-testid` selectors.
- If automation fails, treat the product defect as suspect before weakening the test.
